{"unit_id":"linguiyii__dsh-sidebar-settings#card-zh","repo":"linguiyii/dsh-sidebar-settings","commit":"7f204279c9ad904a0961cee2a0e7f28a19512b40","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-sidebar-settings 是面向 DSH Web 客户端的轻量设置入口插件。它在侧边栏底部注册一个设置按钮，点击后优先调用宿主设置面板的打开 action，并在该接口不可用时通过现有设置行的按钮或账号菜单打开面板。侧栏展开时显示“设置”文字，折叠时保留齿轮图标，并根据页面语言显示中英文标签。适合希望更快进入配置页面的 DSH 用户；插件不要求额外 API 密钥或外部服务，需将其安装到 DSH profile 并重启客户端生效。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:11-18","src/client.js:63-84","src/client.js:94-121","src/client.js:152-185"]}
{"unit_id":"linguiyii__dsh-sidebar-settings#card-en","repo":"linguiyii/dsh-sidebar-settings","commit":"7f204279c9ad904a0961cee2a0e7f28a19512b40","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-sidebar-settings adds a settings shortcut to the DSH web sidebar. Clicking it opens the settings panel through the host action or an existing settings control. The button becomes a gear icon when the sidebar is collapsed. No API key is needed; install it in a DSH profile and restart the client.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:11-18","src/client.js:63-84","src/client.js:94-121","src/client.js:152-185"]}
